{"2767400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Complex Tragedy", "steam_appid": 2767400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767400/extras/30291b96a77749fea2b5e438d44ccad2.poster.avif?t=1780357121\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767400/extras/30291b96a77749fea2b5e438d44ccad2.webm?t=1780357121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2767400/extras/30291b96a77749fea2b5e438d44ccad2.mp4?t=1780357121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Background</strong><br>Explore the enigmatic world of Complex, a one building city abandoned by the government, leaving behind a haunting mystery. Home to 40,000 souls, Complex was abruptly evacuated without explanation, and its borders sealed off from the outside world. Those who left Complex were relocated to a distant island, their communication with the outside world severed by the government.<br><br>Our protagonist, having infiltrated Complex through its sewage system, now faces a point of no return. As the secrets of Complex unfold, embark on a journey to unravel its mysteries within the confines of this desolate place.<br><br>Venture into the unknown corners of Complex, where thousands once thrived. Roam through the spaces where a happy dream turned into a haunting nightmare. Join us as we delve into the heart of Complex, where the answers lie shrouded in secrecy.<br><br><br><strong>User Experience</strong><br>Homes, communal areas, schools, facilities, stores... – these are the visible facets of Complex. Yet, as you delve into the unseen layers, you'll witness an extraordinary and unsettling experience. Explore the hidden faces of Complex, where the familiar transfor